00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:41.930
a hint of what such creatures may be like

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:46.010
seems to surface, oddly, about every 30 years in the far north,

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:48.560
in the cold waters of the Labrador Current.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.200
This is St. John's, Newfoundland,

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.580
